b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1286338-your-fave-martial-arts-for-a-dragon-blood?p=1287158#post1287158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A few of it's charms are pretty broken. It's been a while but i remember doe eyes defense being a huge issue.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean overpowered-broken vs poorly-written/uninterpretable-broken, I take it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-12T15:17:37-08:00","id":1287290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1286338-your-fave-martial-arts-for-a-dragon-blood?p=1287282#post1287282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You mean overpowered-broken vs poorly-written/uninterpretable-broken, I take it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, I do.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T14:34:05-08:00","id":1287675,"title":"","content":"Thank you so much everyone! The Onyx site told me there was an error when I tried to post this so I thought it didn't this went through, and then today I took a look and found these super helpful replies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4620-tumbleweed664","name":"tumbleweed664","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T16:21:13-08:00","id":1287737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1286338-your-fave-martial-arts-for-a-dragon-blood?p=1287290#post1287290\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, I do.</div> </div> </div> </div>Basically, the defense based on Guile thing shouldn\u2019t allow you to add modified Guile because otherwise it\u2019s one of the more efficient existing defense\u2014 if I remember correctly. Other than that I think the style is fine\u2014 and effort must be made to actually exploit the issue in doe eyes defense which should prompt the storyteller to curtail such behavior with a firm word and perhaps a few squirts of water from a spray bottle.<br /> <br /> I quite like Fire dragon\u2014 because it synergizes well with Melee (surprisingly) and Brawl\u2019s signature charm. Golden Janissary is useful for similar reasons. <br /> <br /> Look at the kind of tactics supported by your native Element charms and see what styles support those best. Ebon Shadow and Tiger style\u2019s opening charms worked quite well for the water aspected np I built for a game I ran recently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2116-jivex","name":"JiveX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2116_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T16:36:09-08:00","id":1287747,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JiveX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1286338-your-fave-martial-arts-for-a-dragon-blood?p=1287737#post1287737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Basically, the defense based on Guile thing shouldn\u2019t allow you to add modified Guile because otherwise it\u2019s one of the more efficient existing defense\u2014 if I remember correctly. Other than that I think the style is fine\u2014 and effort must be made to actually exploit the issue in doe eyes defense which should prompt the storyteller to curtail such behavior with a firm word and perhaps a few squirts of water from a spray bottle.<br /> <br /> I quite like Fire dragon\u2014 because it synergizes well with Melee (surprisingly) and Brawl\u2019s signature charm. Golden Janissary is useful for similar reasons.<br /> <br /> Look at the kind of tactics supported by your native Element charms and see what styles support those best. Ebon Shadow and Tiger style\u2019s opening charms worked quite well for the water aspected np I built for a game I ran recently.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can you use them together? I haven't looked at the DB sets recently but combat charms from different abilities can't be strung together unless there's an explicit say so. Fire dragon does also synergize with dodge though which is nice. MA has some decent defenses but it's still kind of lacking and not an all in package like Melee is.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T16:50:43-08:00","id":1287757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1286338-your-fave-martial-arts-for-a-dragon-blood?p=1287747#post1287747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can you use them together? I haven't looked at the DB sets recently but combat charms from different abilities can't be strung together unless there's an explicit say so. Fire dragon does also synergize with dodge though which is nice. MA has some decent defenses but it's still kind of lacking and not an all in package like Melee is.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You can\u2019t on the same action, but for instance golden janissary helps shore up some holes in the Fire aspected Melee Charms (good utility Decisive damage charms and solid withering Charms) it also benefits from mobility\u2014 also a Fire abilities and has a solid clash charm that doesn\u2019t cost willpower. They build out to a neat toolbox if you\u2019re willing to commit the xp even if the charms don\u2019t synergize directly. This is even more true for Dragonblooded who have to juggle their Aura.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2116-jivex","name":"JiveX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2116_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T03:00:10-08:00","id":1287897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1286338-your-fave-martial-arts-for-a-dragon-blood?p=1286933#post1286933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Doesn't Crane have some foundational problems? Maybe they have since been fixed. I have been a little out of the loop.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's an official ruling on the counter attacks (the timing work like Solar Counterattack as per post <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1069023-ask-the-devs?p=1069596#post1069596\">111</a> of the big Ask the Devs). Last I checked the form's special activation rules remain a hypothetical and not something that the style itself is capable of.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}